{
  "_readme": [
    "Presets for the LamarCy World Studio. Edit this file to add your own —",
    "no code changes needed. Each preset is a partial state merged over the",
    "app's defaults, so you only list what differs.",
    "",
    "POSITIONS AND SIZES ARE PERCENTAGES of the canvas (0-100), not pixels,",
    "so a preset built in 9:16 still lands sensibly in 1:1 and 16:9.",
    "text.size is a percentage of canvas HEIGHT.",
    "",
    "text.color / texture.value are INDEXES into the active ramp:",
    "  0 = ink, 1 = deep teal, 2 = tiffany, 3 = cream (or harbor sepia).",
    "There is no free colour field anywhere — that is deliberate.",
    "",
    "sprites[].kind is 'lamarcy', 'keeper' or 'photo'.",
    "  lamarcy poses: idle, walk, play      keeper poses: idle, swim, breach",
    "  'swim' animates when animate:true; idle and breach hold still.",
    "  scale must be a whole number 1-8. z sets layer order, low draws first.",
    "",
    "Only ONE heart per composition. The app refuses to add a second."
  ],

